    "scenesThatPass": [
      "GLENDA: Did you bring the pictures from the sonogram?\nVERONA: We did.",
      "GLENDA: So, how dark do you think she'll be?\nVERONA: Excuse me?",
      "GLENDA: Forget the semantics. We're all family. Verona, how black do you think she'll be?\nVERONA: Uh, I don't really know...\nGLENDA: Because you know she won't be very dark at first. It takes a while for the pigment to settle in.\nVERONA: Well, maybe we could leave her out in the sun for the first couple of days...",
      "PERFORMANCE MOM: Right, Martin Luther! This woman is about to have a baby -- any day now!\nVERONA: Or in three months. Thank you.\nPERFORMANCE MOM: Martin Luther, tell the pretty lady what you know about babies.\nPERFORMANCE MOM: C’mon, tell the nice people.",
      "GRACE: You got lucky, sister.\nVERONA: Yeah. I know."
    ]
  },
